  "summary": "Gcore prices GPUs three ways on one page, and the same card costs a different amount in each: a whole bare-metal cluster by the hour, a one-GPU deployment on its Everywhere Inference endpoints, and a virtual machine. Each rate here says which of the three it came from. Prices are listed in euro and shown with the ECB rate used to convert them; the page notes that VAT is not included.",
